// Source Code Enumeration Detection by Keyword | T1083 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/web/webserver_generic/web_source_code_enumeration.yml
*.git\/*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*.git\\/*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
